    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "3. On a miss, what does the cache do to get the object?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 11,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**The question.** A miss was slow. Did the cache spend its time asking the director for an origin, checking the object exists, or pulling the bytes from the origin?\n\n**Today.** The cache's fetch from the origin is a separate request on a separate server. Nothing links it to the client request that caused it.\n\n**With tracing.** The cache's own steps and the origin's part appear beneath the client's request, in the same trace."
      },
      "id": 12,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Today: nothing\n\nThe cache exports no metric for its fetches from the origin.\n\nThe origin's request metrics include those fetches, mixed with everything else it serves, and with no way to tell which client request each one was for."
      },
      "id": 13,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 27
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "With tracing: the cache's steps on a miss",
      "description": "Average duration, over the last 5 minutes, of what the cache does to fetch an object, and of the origin's part.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "pelican-metrics"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "pelican-metrics"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (span_name) (rate(traces_span_metrics_duration_milliseconds_sum{service_name=\"pelican-cache\",span_name=~\"cache\\\\.(resolve_object|fetch_origin)|client\\\\.(stat|query_director|attempt|verify_checksum)\"}[5m])) / sum by (span_name) (rate(traces_span_metrics_duration_milliseconds_count{service_name=\"pelican-cache\",span_name=~\"cache\\\\.(resolve_object|fetch_origin)|client\\\\.(stat|query_director|attempt|verify_checksum)\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "cache: {{span_name}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "pelican-metrics"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (span_name) (rate(traces_span_metrics_duration_milliseconds_sum{service_name=\"pelican-origin\",span_name=~\"origin\\\\.(serve_object|authorize|read)\"}[5m])) / sum by (span_name) (rate(traces_span_metrics_duration_milliseconds_count{service_name=\"pelican-origin\",span_name=~\"origin\\\\.(serve_object|authorize|read)\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "origin: {{span_name}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "valueMode": "color",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "namePlacement": "left",
        "reduceOptions": {
