    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "4. Why did the director send the client to that server?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 15,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**The question.** A client was sent somewhere unexpected. Which servers did the director consider, how did it rank them, and where did it think the client was?\n\n**Today.** The director counts redirects by destination. Its reasoning is returned only to a client that sends `X-Pelican-Debug`, and is kept nowhere.\n\n**With tracing.** Every recorded redirect keeps the decision. Click a trace ID, open the `director.redirect` span, and read its `director.decision` event and its `pelican.director.*` attributes."
      },
      "id": 16,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Today: redirects by destination",
      "description": "pelican_director_redirects_total: how many, not why.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "pelican-metrics"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "pelican-metrics"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (destination, status_code) (rate(pelican_director_redirects_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{destination}} ({{status_code}})"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "id": 17,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 37
      }
    },
    {
