    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "6. How long does the origin spend authorizing, and how long reading storage?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 25,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 56
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**The question.** The origin is slow. Is it the token check or the storage behind it?\n\n**Today.** The origin times its storage calls and its requests as a whole. The authorization step is not measured, and a storage read is not tied to the request it served.\n\n**With tracing.** Each origin request is split into `origin.authorize` and `origin.read`."
      },
      "id": 26,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 57
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Today: average storage read time",
      "description": "pelican_storage_read_time_seconds: one storage read call, not one request, and nothing about authorization.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "pelican-metrics"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "pelican-metrics"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(pelican_storage_read_time_seconds_sum[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(pelican_storage_read_time_seconds_count[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "one read call"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "pelican-metrics"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(pelican_storage_open_time_seconds_sum[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(pelican_storage_open_time_seconds_count[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "one open call"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "id": 27,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 57
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "With tracing: an origin request, authorize against read (p95)",
      "description": "95th percentile duration of origin.authorize and origin.read.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
